        <detaileddescription>
<para>This value is a bitmask of flags to indicate which time durations of Time for Interlude Period 2 (IP2) are supported. Flags:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><bold>0x0001, bit 0:</bold> Time duration of 10 microseconds is supported</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><bold>0x0002, bit 1:</bold> Time duration of 20 microseconds is supported</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><bold>0x0004, bit 2:</bold> Time duration of 30 microseconds is supported</para>
